      "message": "\u003e \u003e This would break a lot of plugin;\n\u003e \n\u003e What plugin build breakage are you referring to?\n\u003e \n\u003e If the concern is the coordinate change from `@gson//jar` to `//lib:gson`, this should not affect most plugin builds.\n\u003e \n\u003e This change is largely a no-op because WORKSPACE-mode dependencies through external_plugin_deps.bzl remain fully supported, the same as on stable-3.14.\n\u003e \n\u003e Could you provide a specific example of a plugin that would break?\n\nOne example: https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/plugins/owners/+/565721\n\nThere are many more breakages we fixed in stable-3.14 on the plugins side. That was expected for a brand-new version of Gerrit, not a problem at all. The community won\u0027t expect similar breakages on a stable-3.12, which has been around for over one year.",
